{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y 在 S08、S09、S11、S12 这些短停留段里，未标“到时出现”的感受词仍然偏密，普通观众未必来得及扫完；X 的双栏主线更容易一眼抓住。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y 用【】把每段最关键的心理转折直接凸显出来，人物从不服气、怀念、怕孤单到决定带着想念往前走的线索更容易接起来，也更容易理解他为什么这样想、这样选择。它的感受描写更具体，既有身体反应，也有音色、织体和音乐变化的细节，并且部分内容与音乐出现的时机对应。X 更清爽、更容易快速扫读，但右侧短词较像并列标签，感受与人物心理、音乐进程之间的联系不如 Y 清楚。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9c6da71a-de8d-4bea-86b1-008e46f8bade", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T164657488826Z", "elapsed_seconds": 108.297, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T16:48:45.787689+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "8d380d6caa9b2fba020280da56208781af30ac38b2ecb00f69e4045935eac12d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\